<title>PHILIPPINES: Alsons group 9-mth net 641.75 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Alsons group 9-mth net 641.75 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holding company Alsons Consolidated Resources Inc said on Tuesday it posted a net income of 641.75 million pesos for the first nine months of the year inclusive of earnings from its subsidiaries.</p>
<p>The company said it generated revenues amounting to 4.343 billion pesos for the first three quarters of the year.</p>
</text>
